WEBVTT

00:18.580 --> 00:21.300
No, it's not right...

00:31.190 --> 00:32.600
I'm back!

00:33.390 --> 00:35.420
What are you making, Sherry?

00:35.890 --> 00:37.280
A cushion.

00:37.280 --> 00:42.170
I wanted to give it to Yuna Sis 
as a present, but I keep messing it up.

00:42.170 --> 00:45.600
It looks great! 
I'm sure Yuna Sis would love it.

00:45.990 --> 00:47.740
The lights are going out soon.

00:47.740 --> 00:49.010
Oh. Already?

00:49.010 --> 00:49.920
Yeah.

00:52.070 --> 00:53.590
If you want to keep working on it...

00:56.260 --> 00:57.440
I'm heading to bed.

00:57.440 --> 00:58.070
Okay.

01:01.440 --> 01:03.140
Good night you two.

02:46.140 --> 02:50.060
Miss Anz is on her way to Crimonia!

02:50.060 --> 02:53.770
You've been looking forward to it, Yuna Sis!

02:53.770 --> 02:58.740
Now I'll finally be able to eat 
delicious seafood whenever I want!

02:58.740 --> 03:01.360
Good for you, Yuna Sis.

03:01.780 --> 03:03.450
I still have one thing left to do.

03:08.310 --> 03:14.480
So, I'm thinking of having those 
people help with the orphanage.

03:14.480 --> 03:19.270
Aren't they coming to work 
for your restaurant?

03:19.270 --> 03:23.050
There's no need to ask 
them to do additional work...

03:21.920 --> 03:23.050
Hey, now!

03:23.050 --> 03:24.900
Goodness! Give that back!

03:25.510 --> 03:26.510
What're you doing?

03:26.510 --> 03:30.350
Those two don't come to 
help every day, either.

03:30.350 --> 03:36.590
And it's a lot for you and Miss Liz to take 
care of the housework and so many children.

03:36.950 --> 03:41.240
It'll be easier for both of you 
if there are more people to help.

03:41.240 --> 03:46.420
You'll make the children sad 
if either of you faint from exhaustion.

03:47.920 --> 03:51.250
That's true. Thank you very much.

03:52.620 --> 03:54.330
Yuna Sis.

03:54.870 --> 03:56.120
Sherry?

03:56.120 --> 03:59.800
Um, are you still in the middle of talking?

03:59.800 --> 04:01.510
We're finished.

04:01.510 --> 04:02.630
What's up?

04:07.140 --> 04:11.060
Um, this is for you...

04:12.320 --> 04:13.770
A cushion?

04:13.770 --> 04:15.980
Yeah. I made it.

04:16.380 --> 04:17.930
Did you embroider this yourself?

04:21.400 --> 04:23.740
What a cute bear.

04:24.070 --> 04:25.450
Really?

04:25.450 --> 04:27.060
Yeah. Thanks.

04:27.060 --> 04:28.700
I'll take good care of it.

04:40.780 --> 04:43.440
So this is Crimonia?

04:50.660 --> 04:52.520
What a big town.

04:52.520 --> 04:54.950
I'll probably be lost for a while...

04:57.190 --> 04:59.770
Hey, look! A bear shop!

05:01.340 --> 05:03.740
Is this Yuna's shop?

05:03.740 --> 05:05.520
It looks like a bakery.

05:05.520 --> 05:07.330
I want to eat some bread!

05:07.330 --> 05:09.450
I understand how you feel.

05:09.450 --> 05:12.340
But we need to meet with Miss Yuna first!

05:16.120 --> 05:21.410
Sherry likes to embroider and often 
sews things for the other children.

05:21.410 --> 05:23.710
That must be why she's so good at it.

05:23.710 --> 05:25.550
Miss Yuna!

05:25.550 --> 05:27.760
Oh! She's here!

05:32.080 --> 05:35.430
This is the director of this orphanage.

05:35.430 --> 05:37.520
My name is Bow.

05:37.520 --> 05:40.570
My name is Anz! I look forward 
to working with you!

05:40.570 --> 05:42.350
We look forward to working with you.

05:43.220 --> 05:46.210
Yuna, you're going to become our boss, right?

05:46.210 --> 05:48.620
Should I call you Miss Yuna?

05:48.620 --> 05:51.990
Call me whatever makes you feel comfortable.

05:51.990 --> 05:53.000
Bear, then!

05:53.000 --> 05:54.020
But not that.

05:54.020 --> 05:56.160
What? But it'd be so cute!

05:56.160 --> 05:59.120
I forbid that as your boss.

05:59.120 --> 06:01.340
Then... Lady Bear?

06:06.200 --> 06:09.010
Fine. Just Yuna, then.

06:09.010 --> 06:11.230
I'll stick with Miss Yuna.

06:11.230 --> 06:13.600
Miss Yuna, we'll be in your care.

06:13.600 --> 06:16.120
Yeah, I look forward to 
working with all of you.

06:29.100 --> 06:30.640
Yeah. Thanks.

06:30.640 --> 06:31.870
I'll take good care of it.

06:34.950 --> 06:36.930
Good for you, Sherry.

06:36.930 --> 06:39.050
S-Since when were you here?!

06:39.050 --> 06:40.210
Before you.

06:43.570 --> 06:45.880
Looks like your hard work paid off.

06:47.060 --> 06:48.020
Yeah.

06:52.300 --> 06:55.590
Sorry for asking you to help 
with the orphanage, too.

06:55.590 --> 06:57.450
No, we don't mind at all.

06:58.000 --> 07:02.810
Actually, there are even more 
orphans working at this shop.

07:02.810 --> 07:05.730
Oh, this is the bear bakery 
we saw on our way in!

07:05.730 --> 07:08.940
It's my shop.

07:08.940 --> 07:11.530
Just like we thought!

07:11.530 --> 07:15.280
Perfect timing. 
Let's have dinner here tonight.

07:22.710 --> 07:23.900
Yuna Sis!

07:23.900 --> 07:24.880
Welcome!

07:24.880 --> 07:26.610
Looks like you've been working hard.

07:26.610 --> 07:27.590
They're all bears!

07:27.590 --> 07:29.170
They're so cute.

07:29.600 --> 07:32.760
We want to have some dinner. Anything left?

07:33.170 --> 07:35.570
Yeah! I'll go ask Karin Sis!

07:35.570 --> 07:37.600
I'll help!

07:39.960 --> 07:41.810
That was delicious!

07:42.310 --> 07:44.410
Now I just want to sleep.

07:45.760 --> 07:47.470
I forgot...

07:47.470 --> 07:48.570
Forgot, what?

07:48.570 --> 07:53.660
An inn. I meant to look for one 
when we got to Crimonia.

07:53.950 --> 07:55.060
What?

07:55.740 --> 07:58.250
I already prepared a place 
for you girls to stay.

07:59.080 --> 08:03.430
I-Is this the place, Miss Yuna? Are you sure?

08:03.430 --> 08:04.880
I'm sure.

08:04.880 --> 08:07.800
This is going to be your new restaurant.

08:07.800 --> 08:09.070
It's so large...

08:09.070 --> 08:11.100
The restaurant will only be 
on the first floor.

08:11.100 --> 08:13.340
You guys can split up the second 
floor however you want.

08:13.340 --> 08:15.630
Does that mean we can live here?

08:15.630 --> 08:18.070
Yeah. I've already prepared beds upstairs.

08:18.070 --> 08:20.610
Awesome! You're the best, Yuna!

08:20.610 --> 08:22.300
Welp, I'm heading home.

08:22.300 --> 08:24.390
Try your best to wake up on time tomorrow.

08:24.390 --> 08:25.980
Yes!

08:26.300 --> 08:30.240
Really. Thank you for everything, Miss Yuna!

08:31.820 --> 08:34.900
I'm the one who invited you here.

08:34.900 --> 08:38.030
I look forward to working with you, Miss Anz.

08:38.030 --> 08:40.250
Likewise!

08:49.210 --> 08:50.910
This is Ms. Tiermina.

08:50.910 --> 08:53.090
She's in charge of managing my shops.

08:53.090 --> 08:55.180
She's Fina and Shuri's mother.

08:55.180 --> 08:59.140
My daughters tell me 
your food is very delicious.

08:59.700 --> 09:02.220
Oh, no, I still have a long way to go...

09:03.580 --> 09:07.770
Why don't we go over everything 
we need to open your restaurant?

09:07.770 --> 09:08.800
Yes!

09:22.290 --> 09:24.030
Is this everything?

09:24.030 --> 09:26.290
Yes, it should be...

09:25.150 --> 09:26.290
You're not done yet!

09:26.830 --> 09:27.900
Ms. Milaine.

09:27.900 --> 09:31.250
Haven't you forgotten 
something very important?!

09:31.250 --> 09:32.930
Why are you here?

09:32.930 --> 09:37.050
I wanted to let all of you know 
the good news as soon as possible.

09:37.050 --> 09:38.920
Good news?

09:38.920 --> 09:41.820
A ship from Wa has arrived 
in the port of Mileela.

09:41.820 --> 09:44.180
Really?! So, I can eat rice?

09:44.180 --> 09:44.840
Yes.

09:44.840 --> 09:45.770
All right!

09:45.770 --> 09:48.890
That means we'll be able to 
serve dishes with rice here.

09:48.890 --> 09:52.360
By the way, what was the 
important thing we've forgotten?

09:52.760 --> 09:55.440
Of course, the uniforms for this restaurant!

09:55.840 --> 09:58.960
Nice. I completely forgot about that.

09:59.280 --> 10:02.620
I thought so. That's why I had some made!

10:03.150 --> 10:04.090
Huh?

10:06.020 --> 10:07.410
Huh?!

10:07.410 --> 10:08.040
Bears?!

10:08.040 --> 10:11.580
This will be Miss Anz's restaurant, 
so they don't need to dress up as bears.

10:11.580 --> 10:12.770
Right, Miss Anz?

10:12.770 --> 10:17.380
It's cute, but we shouldn't wear 
the same uniforms as little children.

10:17.380 --> 10:20.220
Not to worry. These are in your size.

10:20.220 --> 10:22.850
Huh?! When did you get our measurements?!

10:25.110 --> 10:27.750
<i>This person is so scary.</i>

10:27.750 --> 10:29.730
That's not the problem here.

10:29.730 --> 10:31.940
We should consider everyone's opinions!

10:32.540 --> 10:35.820
Cute clothes like that don't suit me.

10:35.820 --> 10:37.740
Me, too.

10:37.740 --> 10:39.320
I want to wear it!

10:39.320 --> 10:41.600
Really?! Bears are great!

10:41.600 --> 10:43.160
Yes! They're cute!

10:43.160 --> 10:44.590
Wait, Anz?!

10:44.590 --> 10:46.070
We're not wearing these, right?!

10:46.070 --> 10:48.270
U-Um...

10:48.270 --> 10:50.660
<i>She's asking for help?</i>

10:51.540 --> 10:53.180
<i>Uniforms, huh?</i>

10:53.180 --> 10:57.170
<i>Something with a bear that 
isn't embarrassing to wear...</i>

10:57.170 --> 10:58.130
Oh!

10:58.620 --> 11:02.800
Then what about having a bear 
embroidered on your aprons?

11:04.190 --> 11:05.760
How adorable!

11:05.760 --> 11:08.980
Wouldn't this be less embarrassing 
than wearing full bear costumes?

11:08.980 --> 11:10.420
That's a good idea.

11:10.420 --> 11:11.950
I agree, since it's cute!

11:11.950 --> 11:13.310
I'd rather wear something like this, too.

11:13.310 --> 11:16.530
That's too bad, but if
 that's what everyone wants...

11:19.490 --> 11:20.800
Who made this?

11:20.800 --> 11:22.860
A girl named Sherry from the orphanage.

11:23.700 --> 11:26.450
I didn't know she was so talented.

11:26.450 --> 11:29.370
We'll have to gather the materials 
we need from somewhere.

11:29.370 --> 11:31.630
I can introduce you to the perfect place.

11:31.630 --> 11:33.460
I'll inform them you're coming.

11:34.180 --> 11:36.550
Thanks. I'll drop by.

11:41.010 --> 11:43.470
Oh, there isn't enough.

11:43.470 --> 11:45.340
I'm going to go and get some more feed.

11:45.340 --> 11:48.220
I'm almost done. I'll go with you.

11:48.220 --> 11:51.210
Then should we take out 
the trash while we're at it?

11:51.210 --> 11:52.060
Good idea.

11:53.570 --> 11:56.490
There you are! Sherry!

11:56.490 --> 11:58.160
Yuna Sis!

11:59.320 --> 12:05.240
<b>Bear, Guiding the Young Girl</b>

11:59.320 --> 12:05.240
<b>Bear, Guiding the Young Girl</b>

12:04.270 --> 12:08.640
The tailor shop we're going to 
made the uniforms for Bear Haven.

12:08.640 --> 12:11.470
I was told they have a ton of 
different materials to choose from.

12:11.470 --> 12:13.750
Is it really okay for me to embroider them?

12:13.750 --> 12:18.250
Of course. We asked you to do it because 
everyone loves the embroidery you do.

12:18.960 --> 12:21.550
You like to embroider, right?

12:21.550 --> 12:22.850
Yeah...

12:22.850 --> 12:26.470
Then just have fun with it.

12:27.790 --> 12:29.100
Okay.

12:32.140 --> 12:33.440
This is the place.

12:39.560 --> 12:40.480
Welcome.

12:40.480 --> 12:42.030
We were waiting for you.

12:42.490 --> 12:44.740
I'm Yuna. This is Sherry.

12:44.740 --> 12:47.320
Ms. Milaine introduced us to this shop.

12:47.320 --> 12:50.670
My name is Nahru. 
This is my husband, Temocca.

12:50.670 --> 12:51.860
Nice to meet you.

12:51.860 --> 12:55.540
We heard about your project. You want 
to make embroidered aprons, right?

12:55.540 --> 12:58.650
Yes. We want something like this...

12:59.900 --> 13:01.930
My! What a cute bear!

13:01.930 --> 13:03.410
Did you make this?

13:03.410 --> 13:04.350
Yes...

13:04.350 --> 13:05.800
You did a really good job.

13:06.270 --> 13:07.770
That's not true...

13:07.770 --> 13:09.890
We've already prepared the aprons.

13:09.890 --> 13:12.970
Feel free to use anything here 
to embroider them.

13:15.440 --> 13:17.900
You can make things like this?

13:17.900 --> 13:20.190
Are you interested in making clothes?

13:20.700 --> 13:21.700
Yes.

13:22.150 --> 13:25.450
Then would you like to try making an apron?

13:25.450 --> 13:27.240
They're easy to make. I can show you how.

13:27.830 --> 13:29.430
Well...

13:30.790 --> 13:32.910
Do whatever you want, Sherry.

13:43.000 --> 13:44.410
I'd like to learn.

13:50.590 --> 13:53.970
Sherry, didn't you visit the tailor shop today?

13:53.970 --> 13:56.630
There were all sorts of clothes there!

13:56.630 --> 14:02.130
The owners were very nice and they're 
teaching me how to make aprons.

14:02.130 --> 14:02.940
Is that so?

14:02.940 --> 14:06.400
Yeah, there's a lot to remember. 
I'll try my best!

14:06.400 --> 14:08.400
Sounds like fun.

14:08.400 --> 14:09.610
Yeah, sounds fun.

14:09.940 --> 14:10.740
Huh?

14:11.320 --> 14:13.780
It might be a lot of work, but try your best.

14:13.780 --> 14:14.910
We're rooting for you!

14:17.180 --> 14:18.380
I'll try my best.

15:00.750 --> 15:02.490
Sorry! I overslept.

15:02.490 --> 15:03.880
Get a little more sleep, Sherry.

15:03.880 --> 15:04.600
Huh?

15:04.600 --> 15:06.660
We'll take care of...

15:06.660 --> 15:07.670
...all of the kokekkos!

15:08.230 --> 15:09.340
Why?

15:09.340 --> 15:11.580
Aren't you busy making aprons?

15:12.140 --> 15:14.030
Just focus on that.

15:14.030 --> 15:16.470
We can't help you with the sewing...

15:19.400 --> 15:21.710
So we'll do your part, too, Sherry.

15:22.520 --> 15:25.440
Sorry. Thank you.

15:29.950 --> 15:32.410
We're pretty stocked up.

15:32.410 --> 15:34.410
Everything is coming along.

15:34.410 --> 15:36.790
Looks like we'll be able to open soon.

15:37.490 --> 15:39.830
Sherry has been working hard.

15:39.830 --> 15:43.040
Yes. I can't wait to see the finished product!

15:43.490 --> 15:45.490
We have to work hard, too.

15:45.490 --> 15:46.330
Yes!

15:55.290 --> 15:56.890
I'm done!

15:56.890 --> 15:59.150
You worked hard to finish them all.

15:59.150 --> 16:02.350
It's all thanks to your teachings, 
Mr. Temocca and Mrs. Nahru.

16:02.350 --> 16:04.400
Thank you very much.

16:04.820 --> 16:08.890
Sherry, are you interested 
in becoming an apprentice?

16:28.690 --> 16:30.380
Yuna Sis...

16:30.380 --> 16:31.970
Oh! Sherry!

16:32.810 --> 16:33.930
Um...

16:35.050 --> 16:36.600
I'm done.

16:39.480 --> 16:41.870
Wow! They're so cute!

16:41.870 --> 16:43.710
We'll take good care of them!

16:43.710 --> 16:46.750
We'll treat you to a feast when we open up!

16:46.750 --> 16:48.830
Well, Miss Anz will be the one 
making all the food.

16:48.830 --> 16:51.070
I can prep the fish, at least!

16:53.110 --> 16:54.810
What's wrong?

16:56.510 --> 16:57.920
Um...

16:59.550 --> 17:03.010
I'm going back to help 
everyone at the orphanage.

17:03.010 --> 17:04.990
Huh? Sherry?

17:13.820 --> 17:15.840
Hello, is Sherry here?

17:15.840 --> 17:17.180
Oh, Yuna.

17:17.180 --> 17:19.100
I think she's resting in our room.

17:19.100 --> 17:22.020
Lately, she's been up late every night.

17:22.020 --> 17:23.570
I see.

17:23.570 --> 17:24.720
Thanks.

17:27.930 --> 17:29.650
Sherry, are you there?

17:29.650 --> 17:31.020
Yuna Sis?

17:31.020 --> 17:33.040
Can I come in?

17:34.510 --> 17:35.490
Yes.

17:40.910 --> 17:44.430
I came because I wanted to 
thank you properly.

17:46.300 --> 17:47.580
What's wrong?

17:47.580 --> 17:49.070
Oh, yeah...

17:49.070 --> 17:51.340
I'm glad you liked them.

17:51.340 --> 17:56.260
Sherry, did something happen?

18:02.170 --> 18:06.460
Mr. Temocca asked me if I wanted 
to become their apprentice.

18:06.460 --> 18:07.890
What? That's great!

18:09.410 --> 18:12.660
But I'm turning them down.

18:13.320 --> 18:14.620
Why?

18:14.620 --> 18:19.490
Because we decided to take care 
of the kokekkos together.

18:23.540 --> 18:30.430
It's not fair if I quit helping just because 
I want to work at the tailor shop.

18:33.710 --> 18:35.620
Did the others say that?

18:35.620 --> 18:37.420
No, they didn't.

18:37.420 --> 18:41.110
But I made trouble for everyone.

18:42.150 --> 18:44.890
It was really fun to make the aprons.

18:44.890 --> 18:49.100
Mr. Temocca's invitation made me really happy.

18:49.100 --> 18:52.120
But I can't accept.

18:54.190 --> 18:57.680
Why don't we ask everyone about it?

18:57.680 --> 18:58.400
Huh?

18:58.820 --> 19:03.080
I don't think they'd get mad 
just because we asked, right?

19:13.990 --> 19:15.260
I'll try.

19:22.510 --> 19:23.430
Um...

19:25.140 --> 19:29.230
Would it be bad if I started 
working at the tailor shop?

19:30.090 --> 19:33.280
If I do, I don't think I'll be able to 
help with the kokekkos anymore.

19:33.280 --> 19:37.180
But I really want to study sewing.

19:37.690 --> 19:40.450
Can I?

19:47.070 --> 19:48.240
I think that's fine.

19:48.240 --> 19:49.870
You should give it a try, Sherry.

19:50.280 --> 19:51.220
Huh?

19:51.220 --> 19:54.670
You looked so happy while making the aprons.

19:54.670 --> 19:57.630
We were a little worried 
you were working too hard.

19:57.630 --> 19:59.870
That's how much you love doing it.

19:59.870 --> 20:01.490
Then it's decided!

20:01.490 --> 20:04.250
B-But you'll have more work because of me.

20:04.250 --> 20:07.520
It's not fair that I'm the only one 
who does what I want.

20:07.520 --> 20:09.270
Not really.

20:09.690 --> 20:13.480
I'm working at the bakery instead 
of taking care of the kokekkos, too.

20:13.480 --> 20:14.940
Me, too!

20:14.940 --> 20:17.820
We all decided on what we wanted to do.

20:17.820 --> 20:20.110
I really like taking care of the kokekkos.

20:20.110 --> 20:21.520
It's fun.

20:22.640 --> 20:27.990
Sherry, it's your life. 
You shouldn't leave any regrets.

20:30.920 --> 20:33.720
Thanks, everyone...

20:34.460 --> 20:37.920
I want to work at the tailor shop!

20:48.110 --> 20:51.770
The Bear Diner is now open!

20:51.770 --> 20:53.650
Excuse me!

20:53.650 --> 20:55.380
I want this one!

20:55.380 --> 20:58.490
One order of grilled fish, three-colored 
rice balls, and a fresh seafood rice bowl!

20:58.490 --> 20:59.550
Got it!

20:59.550 --> 21:00.880
Welcome!

21:01.300 --> 21:03.370
One grilled fish meal!

21:07.170 --> 21:09.080
Yummy!

21:10.700 --> 21:12.290
It really is.

21:27.040 --> 21:28.560
Will you come tomorrow, too?

21:32.930 --> 21:35.120
So relaxing!

21:46.400 --> 21:49.360
Um, I don't quite understand this part.

21:49.360 --> 21:51.120
This? Well, this part...

21:56.430 --> 22:00.300
Welp, guess I'll head over 
to the guild or something.

23:35.430 --> 23:40.370
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:35.430 --> 23:40.370
<b>Bear, Seeking Mithril</b>

23:36.120 --> 23:37.200
Bear.
